## Hand-drawn 32x32 battle sprites: "front" faces the player across the
## field, "back" is the player's own monster seen from behind.
##
## Letters are colors from the monster's entry in PixelArt.MONSTERS; "." is
## transparent. Shared by every monster: K and E ink (inner lines, eyes),
## W white (eye glints, claws). Common per-monster letters: B/b/L body base,
## shade and light. Draw only the inside: PixelArt.monster() adds the outer
## ink outline around the silhouette, so keep row 0, row 31, column 0 and
## column 31 empty.

